#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:376
msgid ""
"Whenever Gnumeric opens or saves a file, the file status indicator appears "
"with a progress bar which grows as Gnumeric progresses. In <xref "
"linkend=\"info-area.png\"/>, Gnumeric was just over halfway done opening a "
"file."
msgstr ""
"När Gnumeric öppnar eller sparar en fil visas en förloppsindikator som fylls"
" i takt med att arbetet fortskrider. I <xref linkend=\"info-area.png\"/> har"
" Gnumeric kommit lite mer än halvvägs genom att öppna en fil."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:390
msgid ""
"In the bottom right hand corner, is an info area that shows some constantly "
"calculated values. The default set is to show the Sum of all the currently "
"selected cells."
msgstr ""
"Längst ned till höger finns ett informationsfält som visar värden som "
"beräknas löpande. Som standard visas summan av alla markerade celler."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:394
msgid ""
"There is a right click option that includes a few more options. This can "
"include Sum, Min, Max, Average, Count."
msgstr ""
"Via snabbmenyn kan du välja fler beräkningar, till exempel Summa, Min, Max, "
"Medelvärde och Antal."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:4
msgid ""
"The shape of the mouse pointer (the pointer which is movable by the mouse) "
"changes in different contexts. This indicates that different functionality "
"is available and that mouse clicks will have different results. The "
"different mouse pointers and the actions they indicate are discussed below."
msgstr ""
"Muspekaren ändrar utseende beroende på sammanhang. Det visar att olika "
"funktioner är tillgängliga och att musklick kan ge olika resultat. Nedan "
"beskrivs de olika pekarna och vad de används till."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:15
msgid ""
"<inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata "
"fileref=\"figures/pointer_left.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> "
"<textobject> <phrase>An arrow pointing to the upper left.</phrase> "
"</textobject> </inlinemediaobject> The left pointing arrow pointer:"
msgstr ""
"<inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata "
"fileref=\"figures/pointer_left.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> "
"<textobject> <phrase>En pil som pekar snett uppåt åt vänster.</phrase> "
"</textobject> </inlinemediaobject> Den vänsterpekande pilpekaren:"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:28
msgid ""
"The left hand pointing arrow pointer is the standard pointer used for most "
"of the interaction with <application>Gnumeric</application>. This pointer is"
" used to select menus and menu entries, toolbar buttons, columns or rows, "
"the scrolling `thumbs' and various other elements."
msgstr ""
"Den vänsterpekande pilpekaren är standardpekaren och används vid de flesta "
"interaktioner med <application>Gnumeric</application>. Med den väljer du "
"menyer och menyobjekt, verktygsfältsknappar, kolumner och rader, "
"rullningslisternas handtag och andra objekt."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:39
msgid ""
"<inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata "
"fileref=\"figures/pointer_cross_wide.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> "
"<textobject> <phrase>A wide white cross with black shading.</phrase> "
"</textobject> </inlinemediaobject> The cell selection pointer:"
msgstr ""
"<inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata "
"fileref=\"figures/pointer_cross_wide.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> "
"<textobject> <phrase>Ett brett vitt kors med svart skuggning.</phrase> "
"</textobject> </inlinemediaobject> Cellmarkeringspekaren:"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:52
msgid ""
"This pointer appears over the cell grid area and can be used to select cells"
" for editing."
msgstr ""
"Den här pekaren visas över cellrutnätet och används för att markera celler "
"som ska redigeras."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:60
msgid ""
"<inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata "
"fileref=\"figures/pointer_text_edit.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> "
"<textobject> <phrase>A vertical bar limited at each end by short horizontal "
"stubs.</phrase> </textobject> </inlinemediaobject> The text editing pointer:"
msgstr ""
"<inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata "
"fileref=\"figures/pointer_text_edit.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> "
"<textobject> <phrase>Ett lodrätt streck med korta tvärstreck i båda "
"ändarna.</phrase> </textobject> </inlinemediaobject> Textredigeringspekaren:"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:74
msgid ""
"The text editing pointer is used to indicate the location in the text where "
"new edits will appear. This cursor can be used to change the scale of the "
"zoom, to change the name and size of the font currently used or to edit the "
"cell contents in the cell entry area (the white area to the right of the "
"equals (=) sign."
msgstr ""
"Textredigeringspekaren visar var ny text kommer att infogas. Den kan "
"användas för att ändra zoomnivån, byta namn på eller storlek för det "
"aktuella teckensnittet och redigera cellinnehållet i inmatningsfältet (det "
"vita området till höger om likhetstecknet (=))."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:86
msgid ""
"<inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata "
"fileref=\"figures/pointer_cross_hair.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> "
"<textobject> <phrase>A thin cross pointer</phrase> </textobject> "
"</inlinemediaobject> The cross hair pointer:"
msgstr ""
"<inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata "
"fileref=\"figures/pointer_cross_hair.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> "
"<textobject> <phrase>En tunn korsformad pekare.</phrase> </textobject> "
"</inlinemediaobject> Korspekaren:"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:99
msgid ""
"The cross hair pointer can be used to change the cell selection area. The "
"pointer appears when the mouse pointer is placed over the handle box, the "
"black square at the lower right hand side of the selection. When the cross "
"hair pointer appear, the selection can be altered by clicking the left-hand "
"mouse button and dragging the handle to a new position. The cross hair "
"pointer can also be used to insert a graphic object, by clicking with the "
"left hand mouse button to place one corner and releasing the button to place"
" another of the corners."
msgstr ""
"Korspekaren används för att ändra cellmarkeringen. Den visas när muspekaren "
"placeras över handtaget, den svarta rutan längst ned till höger om "
"markeringen. När korspekaren visas kan du ändra markeringen genom att hålla "
"ned vänster musknapp och dra handtaget till en ny plats. Du kan också "
"använda korspekaren för att infoga ett grafiskt objekt: klicka med vänster "
"musknapp där du vill placera ett hörn och släpp knappen vid nästa hörn."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:115
msgid ""
"<inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata "
"fileref=\"figures/pointer_double_vertical_arrow.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> "
"</imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>A double ended vertical arrow.</phrase> "
"</textobject> </inlinemediaobject> <inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> "
"<imagedata fileref=\"figures/pointer_double_horizontal_arrow.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>A double ended "
"horizontal arrow.</phrase> </textobject> </inlinemediaobject> The expansion "
"pointers:"
msgstr ""
"<inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata "
"fileref=\"figures/pointer_double_vertical_arrow.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> "
"</imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En lodrät dubbelpil.</phrase> "
"</textobject> </inlinemediaobject> <inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> "
"<imagedata fileref=\"figures/pointer_double_horizontal_arrow.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En vågrät "
"dubbelpil.</phrase> </textobject> </inlinemediaobject> Pekarna för "
"storleksändring:"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:139
msgid ""
"These pointers can be used to change the height of rows or the width of "
"columns. These pointers appear in certain dialog windows to resize the "
"different parts of the dialog. The pointers are also used to resize "
"graphical objects as is explained below."
msgstr ""
"Med de här pekarna ändrar du radhöjd eller kolumnbredd. De visas också i "
"vissa dialogrutor när du ändrar storlek på rutans olika delar. Som beskrivs "
"nedan används pekarna även för att ändra storlek på grafiska objekt."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:150
msgid ""
"<inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata "
"fileref=\"figures/pointer_hand_left.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> "
"<textobject> <phrase>A left pointing hand icon.</phrase> </textobject> "
"</inlinemediaobject> The sheet selection and hyperlink pointer:"
msgstr ""
"<inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata "
"fileref=\"figures/pointer_hand_left.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> "
"<textobject> <phrase>En hand som pekar åt vänster.</phrase> </textobject> "
"</inlinemediaobject> Pekaren för bladval och hyperlänkar:"
